# RMALC v1.2 remainder-closure state
MODULE rmalc.remainder_closure
SURFACE canonical

CLAIM RC_KEYBOARD STATUS VERIFIED_COMPUTATION TEXT "real Unicode keyboard strings route through the tested deterministic keyboard carrier"
CLAIM RC_AUDIO STATUS VERIFIED_COMPUTATION TEXT "real RIFF/WAV PCM samples route through the tested direct spectral audio carrier"
CLAIM RC_FINITE_OPT STATUS EXACT_FINITE TEXT "declared rank/ridge configuration grids are exhaustively enumerated before deterministic selection"
BOUNDARY RC_KEYBOARD CLAIM_CEILING VERIFIED_COMPUTATION REASON "routing accuracy does not prove downstream semantic correctness"
BOUNDARY RC_AUDIO CLAIM_CEILING VERIFIED_COMPUTATION REASON "eSpeak synthetic speech does not establish human voice generalization"
BOUNDARY RC_FINITE_OPT CLAIM_CEILING EXACT_FINITE REASON "finite declared grid only; not universal optimizer optimality"
REMAINDER "Real semantic problem-solving correctness inside maths, poetry, music, STEM, literature, types, kinds, varies, parameters, and research is not established by routing/classification accuracy."
REMAINDER "Human voice generalization remains unresolved: the audio benchmark uses actual PCM waveforms generated by eSpeak, not independently recorded human speakers."
REMAINDER "Universal future-distribution generalization cannot be proved from finite held-out panels; only the declared shifts are tested."
REMAINDER "Universal optimizer optimality remains undefined/open beyond the explicitly enumerated finite configuration families."
REMAINDER "End-to-end generation quality for arbitrary requested outputs requires task-specific executors/verifiers beyond the current REQUEST/NEED/SOLVE/EXPLAIN/BUILD/VERIFY router."